{"seq":1,"slug":"rl-evolutionary","title":"强化学习与进化搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/search-strategies/rl-evolutionary","wordCount":1462,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"强化学习与进化搜索\">强化学习与进化搜索</h1><p>NAS 的第一批成功方法没有用任何关于架构的梯度信息——它们把架构搜索当成纯粹的黑箱优化：丢一个架构进去，训练它，拿回一个验证精度分数，仅此而已。在这个黑箱设定下，两套成熟的优化范式自然登场：强化学习让一个控制器学会「生成」好架构，进化算法让一个种群「进化」出好架构。这两类方法搜出了 NASNet 和 AmoebaNet 这样的早期标杆，也因为成本惊人，成了后续一切提效研究的起跑线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两种黑箱搜索范式\">核心概念：两种黑箱搜索范式</h2><p>强化学习和进化都把 <a href=\"../foundations/nas-problem\">NAS 三件套</a> 里的「搜索策略」实例化为黑箱优化器，区别在于它们如何利用历史评估来决定下一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[搜索空间编码&lt;br/&gt;序列/DAG] --&gt; B{搜索范式}&#10;    B --&gt;|强化学习| C[控制器 RNN&lt;br/&gt;采样架构序列]&#10;    C --&gt; D[训练子网络&lt;br/&gt;得验证精度]&#10;    D --&gt;|精度当奖励&lt;br/&gt;策略梯度| C&#10;    B --&gt;|进化| E[架构种群]&#10;    E --&gt; F[选择+变异&lt;br/&gt;生成子代]&#10;    F --&gt;|训练评估&lt;br/&gt;优胜劣汰| E\">flowchart TD\n    A[搜索空间编码&lt;br/&gt;序列/DAG] --&gt; B{搜索范式}\n    B --&gt;|强化学习| C[控制器 RNN&lt;br/&gt;采样架构序列]\n    C --&gt; D[训练子网络&lt;br/&gt;得验证精度]\n    D --&gt;|精度当奖励&lt;br/&gt;策略梯度| C\n    B --&gt;|进化| E[架构种群]\n    E --&gt; F[选择+变异&lt;br/&gt;生成子代]\n    F --&gt;|训练评估&lt;br/&gt;优胜劣汰| E</pre><p>两者都依赖<a href=\"../foundations/search-eval-basics\">搜索与评估基础</a>里讲的评估反馈，区别只在「怎么用反馈」：RL 把反馈当奖励信号更新一个参数化的控制器，进化把反馈当适应度做种群级的选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"强化学习-控制器生成架构\">强化学习：控制器生成架构</h2><p>Zoph 和 Le 2017 年的开创性工作把架构生成建模成一个序列决策问题。一个 RNN <strong>控制器</strong>逐步输出描述架构的离散 token——第一层用什么算子、第二层用什么、连到哪里——直到生成一个完整架构。这个架构被训练到收敛，验证精度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 作为奖励反传给控制器。</p>\n<p>控制器的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 用策略梯度（REINFORCE）更新。目标是最大化期望奖励：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla_\\theta J(\\theta) = \\mathbb{E}_{a_{1:T} \\sim \\pi_\\theta}\\left[\\sum_{t=1}^{T} \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\pi_\\theta(a_t \\mid a_{1:t-1}) \\cdot (R - b)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{1:T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是控制器采样出的架构 token 序列，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是该架构的验证精度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个用于降方差的基线（通常是近期奖励的滑动平均）。直觉上，如果一个架构表现好（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &gt; b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>），就提高控制器再次生成它的概率；表现差就降低。</p>\n<p>NASNet 在此基础上做了关键改进：控制器不再生成整个网络，而只生成一个可重复堆叠的 <a href=\"../foundations/search-space\">cell</a>。这把搜索空间从「整网」缩到「单元」，让搜出的结构能从 CIFAR-10 迁移到 ImageNet。但成本依然惊人——NASNet 约 2000 GPU·天，因为每个被采样的架构都要诚实训练。</p>\n<h2 id=\"进化搜索-种群优胜劣汰\">进化搜索：种群优胜劣汰</h2><p>进化算法走的是完全不同的路：不学任何参数化模型，而是维护一个架构<strong>种群</strong>，靠生物进化的隐喻迭代改良。基本循环是：从种群里选若干个体（按适应度，即验证精度），对它们做<strong>变异</strong>（随机改一条边的算子、加减一个连接），生成子代，训练评估，再放回种群、淘汰差的。</p>\n<p>AmoebaNet（Real 等，2019）提出的<strong>正则化进化（regularized evolution）<strong>是这条线的标杆。它的关键创新很简单却有效：淘汰个体时不淘汰最差的，而淘汰</strong>最老的</strong>（age-based tournament selection）。这种「按年龄淘汰」的正则避免了种群被少数早期幸运个体长期主导，让搜索持续探索新区域。AmoebaNet 首次让进化在大规模搜索上超过了强化学习，但成本也更高——约 3150 GPU·天。</p>\n<p>进化的变异算子直接作用在架构编码上，所以它对编码方式特别敏感——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/search-space\">搜索空间设计</a> 里强调的编码选择会反过来约束搜索策略的一个具体例子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种范式的对比\">两种范式的对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>强化学习（NASNet）</th>\n<th>进化（AmoebaNet）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心对象</td>\n<td>参数化控制器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无参数的架构种群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利用历史的方式</td>\n<td>策略梯度更新控制器</td>\n<td>种群选择 + 变异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>探索机制</td>\n<td>控制器的随机采样</td>\n<td>变异 + 年龄正则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超参敏感度</td>\n<td>高（学习率、基线、熵正则）</td>\n<td>中（种群大小、锦标赛规模）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行性</td>\n<td>较难（控制器是串行依赖）</td>\n<td>天然并行（个体独立评估）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型成本</td>\n<td>~2000 GPU·天</td>\n<td>~3150 GPU·天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大规模表现</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>略强（首次超越 RL）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个实践共识是：在同等评估预算下，正则化进化通常比 RL 控制器更稳健、更易并行，且对超参没那么挑剔。但两者的绝对成本都高到离谱——这正是问题所在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么这条路必须被提效\">为什么这条路必须被提效</h2><p>强化学习和进化证明了 NAS 可行，也暴露了它的死穴：成本被「每个候选都要诚实训练」彻底锁死。NASNet 的 2000 GPU·天意味着只有极少数机构玩得起。这个困境催生了三个方向的突破：<a href=\"gradient-darts\">可微分搜索 DARTS</a> 用梯度把搜索成本砍到几个 GPU·天；<a href=\"../efficiency/weight-sharing\">权重共享</a> 让所有候选共用参数、一次训练顶一万次（ENAS 正是「RL 控制器 + 权重共享」的结合，把 NASNet 的成本砍了上千倍）；<a href=\"../efficiency/zero-cost-proxies\">零成本代理</a> 干脆不训练。换句话说，本 hub 后面大半内容，都是在回答这一篇留下的问题：黑箱搜索很好，但太贵，怎么办？</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>强化学习和进化把架构搜索当纯黑箱优化，只用「架构→验证精度」的反馈，不依赖任何架构梯度。</li>\n<li>RL 用 RNN 控制器逐 token 生成架构，靠 REINFORCE 策略梯度更新；NASNet 用它搜可迁移的 cell。</li>\n<li>进化维护架构种群靠变异+选择改良；AmoebaNet 的「按年龄淘汰」正则让进化首次超越 RL。</li>\n<li>进化更易并行、对超参更鲁棒；但两类方法成本都达数千 GPU·天，被「每个候选都要诚实训练」锁死。</li>\n<li>这个成本死穴直接催生了 <a href=\"gradient-darts\">DARTS</a>、<a href=\"../efficiency/weight-sharing\">权重共享</a>、<a href=\"../efficiency/zero-cost-proxies\">零成本代理</a>——后续章节都在解这一篇留下的难题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"强化学习与进化搜索","id":"强化学习与进化搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两种黑箱搜索范式","id":"核心概念-两种黑箱搜索范式"},{"level":2,"text":"强化学习：控制器生成架构","id":"强化学习-控制器生成架构"},{"level":2,"text":"进化搜索：种群优胜劣汰","id":"进化搜索-种群优胜劣汰"},{"level":2,"text":"两种范式的对比","id":"两种范式的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么这条路必须被提效","id":"为什么这条路必须被提效"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"搜索与评估基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/foundations/search-eval-basics"},"next":{"title":"可微分搜索 DARTS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/search-strategies/gradient-darts"}}